{
  "short_id": "short307",
  "episode_id": "PD-2026-073-uri",
  "voice_stage": "master",
  "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
  "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
  "estimated_cost_usd": 0.276,
  "total_seconds": 51.23,
  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-073-uri\\06_voice\\master\\short307_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "This is a story about a recommendation that was written down and not made a rule.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.18,
      "seconds": 4.18,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:7e002f3e43a109a3fcb317e86d23394221ace65e1b36e097f4aec03cf7b61b54"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "In two thousand and eleven, Texas got weather like this. Rolling blackouts were ordered.",
      "start": 4.4,
      "end": 9.23,
      "seconds": 4.83,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:022d351e9d806fcdc22af60a84f78d6ea39d70240f2350322aae08a48260261e"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "They produced a report. It recommended winterization standards.",
      "start": 9.45,
      "end": 13.165,
      "seconds": 3.715,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:475bb127d9968f63ef651fa8e8121261ed4b25016a7dd4dc594ec17ff0ef9120"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "A recommendation is a document. Nobody is penalised for ignoring one. A standard is a rule with a mechanism behind it.",
      "start": 13.385,
      "end": 20.537,
      "seconds": 7.152,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:a1782a90cd5fe170780e5c4832402f5c5a84afd57ad61b0c40a11b8e4ff2e82e"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "The standards organisation ultimately declined to act on it. Nobody refused in a room with a table.",
      "start": 20.757,
      "end": 26.237,
      "seconds": 5.48,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:0db67b9d1918fad05d190c3dec4f6a95b364990d848e45c73ebe8bb69664a57b"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Ten years passed between the report and the storm. When February twenty twenty-one arrived, generating units failed from freezing above their own stated ambient design temperature.",
      "start": 26.457,
      "end": 36.024,
      "seconds": 9.567,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:a35dfbcb638e383f9d60e6dd97e813482c69eb0039cf96568c308b58bf91cd8f"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Not below the temperature the unit was built to survive. Above it. The machines were failing in weather they were rated for.",
      "start": 36.244,
      "end": 42.374,
      "seconds": 6.13,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:f6f01aed46c0c90e88bc92ba4218d9db0a534ac41ccc9f71b6763efd0c68a5bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "And the rules themselves were adopted on the thirtieth of August, twenty twenty-two. Eleven years, five months and nineteen days after the report that recommended them.",
      "start": 42.594,
      "end": 51.232,
      "seconds": 8.638,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:c9804582e1cf6118ab5511623d58814c600b8058a7d865562af0807b6469d8fd"
    }
  ]
}
